                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1914-12-28">December 28, 1914</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>[This is a decree by Governor Luis Caballero of the State of Tamaulipas, dated
                    December 28, 1914, providing that the term for filing tax statements required by
                    Article 5 of the Decree of September 19, 1914 (inclosure 1), be extended “for
                    sixty days,” without specifying the date from which the sixty days is to run. It
                    makes no reference to the Decree of November 11 by the Acting Governor
                    (inclosure 2), extending the Decree of September 19 to December 31.]</p>
            </div>
